{"id":"1cd0ba01-2b88-400c-ae75-c516678f8095","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:51:27.115Z","batchId":"settings_qwen3-8-flash-opencode-go_low","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-opencode-go","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<h1>Account settings</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, decide how we notify you, and control your privacy. Changes are saved per section.</p>\n\n<div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n    <button class=\"btn\" id=\"tab-profile\" onclick=\"showTab('profile')\">Profile</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"tab-notifications\" onclick=\"showTab('notifications')\">Notifications</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"tab-privacy\" onclick=\"showTab('privacy')\">Privacy &amp; security</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ══ PROFILE ══ -->\n  <div id=\"section-profile\" class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <div>\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Profile</h3>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">This information is shown to your teammates and on your public profile card.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg center\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:64px;height:64px;font-size:1.4rem\">MJ</div>\n        <div class=\"stack\">\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\">Change photo</button>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Remove</button>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"muted small\">JPG, GIF or PNG. 2&nbsp;MB max. Recommended 400×400px.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n        <label>Full name\n          <input type=\"text\" value=\"Maya Joshi\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Username\n          <input type=\"text\" value=\"maya.joshi\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Email address\n          <input type=\"email\" value=\"maya@northwind.io\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Phone number\n          <input type=\"tel\" value=\"+1 (415) 555-0182\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Job title\n          <input type=\"text\" value=\"Staff Product Designer\">\n        </label>\n        <label>Location\n          <input type=\"text\" value=\"San Francisco, CA\">\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <label>Bio\n        <textarea rows=\"3\">Designing data-heavy tools that people actually enjoy opening. Previously at Lumen and Fieldwork.</textarea>\n      </label>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label>Timezone\n          <select>\n            <option selected>(GMT-07:00) Pacific Time — San Francisco</option>\n            <option>(GMT-05:00) Eastern Time — New York</option>\n            <option>(GMT+00:00) UTC — London</option>\n            <option>(GMT+05:30) India Standard Time — Bengaluru</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Language\n          <select>\n            <option selected>English (US)</option>\n            <option>English (UK)</option>\n            <option>Deutsch</option>\n            <option>Español</option>\n            <option>日本語</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row between gap-lg\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <div class=\"stack\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:240px\">\n          <div class=\"row between\">\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Workplace storage</span>\n            <span class=\"small muted\">18.4 GB of 50 GB used</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:37%\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-block\" style=\"max-width:220px\" onclick=\"saved('profile')\">Save profile</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <p id=\"saved-profile\" class=\"small\" style=\"display:none;color:var(--green,#16803c)\">✓ Profile changes saved.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <div class=\"stack\">\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">Plan</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-value\">Team Pro</span>\n          <span class=\"badge\">Verified email</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stack\">\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">Member since</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-value\">Mar 2022</span>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">4 yr 7 mo</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stack\">\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">Role</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-value\">Admin</span>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Northwind · Design org</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ══ NOTIFICATIONS ══ -->\n  <div id=\"section-notifications\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"display:none\">\n\n    <div class=\"alert\">\n      <div><strong>Quiet hours are on.</strong> Non-urgent notifications are held between 21:30 and 07:00 Pacific Time.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <div>\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Notifications</h3>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose what reaches you and where. Security alerts are always delivered.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <h4>Activity</h4>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"row between\"><div class=\"stack\"><strong>Mentions &amp; replies</strong><span class=\"muted small\">Someone @-mentions you or replies to your thread</span></div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Email</label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Push</label></div></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><div class=\"stack\"><strong>Assigned tasks</strong><span class=\"muted small\">A task is assigned or reassigned to you</span></div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Email</label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Push</label></div></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><div class=\"stack\"><strong>Comments on followed items</strong><span class=\"muted small\">New activity in projects you follow</span></div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Email</label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Push</label></div></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><div class=\"stack\"><strong>Invitations</strong><span class=\"muted small\">Invites to teams, shared docs and review requests</span></div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Email</label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Push</label></div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <h4>Product &amp; billing</h4>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"row between\"><div class=\"stack\"><strong>Product updates</strong><span class=\"muted small\">Release notes and new features, roughly monthly</span></div>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Email</label></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><div class=\"stack\"><strong>Invoices &amp; receipts</strong><span class=\"muted small\">Sent for every payment on the Team Pro plan</span></div>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Email</label></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><div class=\"stack\"><strong>Usage milestones</strong><span class=\"muted small\">When you cross 80% and 100% of any quota</span></div>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Email</label></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <h4>Delivery &amp; digest</h4>\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n          <label>Digest frequency\n            <select>\n              <option>Real time</option>\n              <option selected>Daily at 08:00</option>\n              <option>Weekly (Monday)</option>\n              <option>Never</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n          <label>Push device\n            <select>\n              <option selected>All devices</option>\n              <option>MacBook Pro only</option>\n              <option>iPhone 16 only</option>\n              <option>None</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Also send a text message (SMS) for urgent security alerts</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Group low-priority notifications to reduce noise</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Notify me when teammates export data I own</label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"saved('notifications')\">Save notification settings</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Reset to defaults</button>\n      </div>\n      <p id=\"saved-notifications\" class=\"small\" style=\"display:none;color:var(--green,#16803c)\">✓ Notification preferences saved.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ══ PRIVACY ══ -->\n  <div id=\"section-privacy\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"display:none\">\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <div>\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Privacy</h3>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Control who can find you and how your data is used across the workspace.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <h4>Profile visibility</h4>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"vis\"> <span><strong>Public</strong> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Current</span><br><span class=\"muted small\">Anyone with the link and all directory users can see your profile.</span></span></label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"vis\" checked> <span><strong>Team only</strong><br><span class=\"muted small\">Visible to members of Northwind. Hidden from the public directory.</span></span></label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"vis\"> <span><strong>Private</strong><br><span class=\"muted small\">Only people you share work with directly. You won't appear in search results.</span></span></label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h4>Data &amp; discovery</h4>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Allow search engines to index my public profile</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Show my activity status (\"online\") to teammates</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Include my usage in anonymised product analytics</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Require approval before third-party apps access my data</label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"saved('privacy')\">Save privacy settings</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Download my data</button>\n      </div>\n      <p id=\"saved-privacy\" class=\"small\" style=\"display:none;color:var(--green,#16803c)\">✓ Privacy settings saved.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"card-title\">Security</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Recent sign-in activity and your active sessions.</p>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"badge\">2-step verification on</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row between\"><div class=\"stack\"><strong>Two-step verification</strong><span class=\"muted small\">Authenticator app · backup codes downloaded Sep 2026</span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\">Reconfigure</button></div>\n      <div class=\"row between\"><div class=\"stack\"><strong>Password</strong><span class=\"muted small\">Last changed 4 months ago · meets policy</span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\">Change password</button></div>\n      <div class=\"row between\"><div class=\"stack\"><strong>Recovery email</strong><span class=\"muted small\">m.joshi@fastmail.com</span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Edit</button></div>\n\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"line\",\"title\":\"Sign-ins · last 12 weeks\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":14},{\"label\":\"W2\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"W3\",\"value\":12},{\"label\":\"W4\",\"value\":21},{\"label\":\"W5\",\"value\":19},{\"label\":\"W6\",\"value\":24},{\"label\":\"W7\",\"value\":17},{\"label\":\"W8\",\"value\":15},{\"label\":\"W9\",\"value\":22},{\"label\":\"W10\",\"value\":26},{\"label\":\"W11\",\"value\":20},{\"label\":\"W12\",\"value\":23}]}'></div>\n\n      <div>\n        <h4>Active sessions</h4>\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>Device</th><th>Location</th><th>Last active</th><th class=\"num\">Status</th><th></th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>MacBook Pro · Chrome 139</td><td>San Francisco, US</td><td>Now</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"badge\">This device</span></td><td><button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Manage</button></td></tr>\n            <tr><td>iPhone 16 · Northwind app</td><td>San Francisco, US</td><td>2 hours ago</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Active</span></td><td><button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Revoke</button></td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Windows 11 · Edge</td><td>Denver, US</td><td>6 days ago</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Active</span></td><td><button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Revoke</button></td></tr>\n            <tr><td>iPad Air · Safari</td><td>San Francisco, US</td><td>Aug 14, 2026</td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Unrecognised</span></td><td><button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-destructive\">Revoke</button></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">Revoking a session signs the device out within a minute. Unrecognised sessions are reviewed automatically.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"alert-destructive alert stack\">\n        <h4>Delete account</h4>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">Deleting your account removes your profile, sessions and personal drafts. Shared work stays with Northwind and transfers to the workspace owner. This cannot be undone; you have a 30-day grace period before permanent deletion.</p>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-destructive\">Delete account</button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Talk to support first</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\nfunction showTab(name){\n  ['profile','notifications','privacy'].forEach(function(t){\n    document.getElementById('section-'+t).style.display = (t===name ? '' : 'none');\n    var b = document.getElementById('tab-'+t);\n    b.className = (t===name ? 'btn' : 'btn btn-secondary');\n  });\n}\nfunction saved(name){\n  var el = document.getElementById('saved-'+name);\n  if(!el) return;\n  el.style.display='block';\n  clearTimeout(el._t);\n  el._t = setTimeout(function(){ el.style.display='none'; }, 2500);\n}\n</script>","de